// The growth of the base is limited in the session with many edits: editing grows the base for
// disassembled text (new imports), and elaboration again, recalculation of the parsing raw block,
// chain trees, samples, n_X {} ct code and new interpreters (check, run, JIT) with the same result
// take the former derivatives of node - (Q§7.4 *my: * node too). Prior to this, each round added
// ~210 node and ~430 journal entries.
//
// program: db_growth.vish
stats
edit other
other() => 7;
.
check
run
// expect: 300 15 7⏎16⏎42 abab⏎true 6
jit
stats
// first round: derivatives of the first elaboration - once
edit other
other() => 7;
.
check
run
jit
stats
// expect: рост: узлов +3, журнал +9
edit other
other() => 7;
.
check
// expect: из кэша
run
// expect: 300 15 7⏎16⏎42 abab⏎true 6
jit
stats
// expect: рост: узлов +3, журнал +9
run
check
run
stats
// expect: рост: узлов +0, журнал +0
roundtrip
// expect: roundtrip: совпадает
